{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "help-pr-mobile-apis-only",
    "name": "Help PR — Mobile APIs only",
    "description": "Postman collection for **`/api/mobile/*`** only.\n\n**Partner app**\n- `GET /api/mobile/partner/states` — all states (no auth)\n- `GET /api/mobile/partner/cities?state_id=` — cities for state(s) (no auth)\n- `GET /api/mobile/partner/areas?city_id=` — areas for city/cities (no auth)\n- `GET /api/mobile/partner/pincodes?area_id=` — pincodes for area (no auth)\n- `POST /api/mobile/partner/register` — JSON, no auth\n- `POST /api/mobile/partner/login` — JSON, no auth\n- `PUT /api/mobile/partner/update` — **multipart/form-data only**, Bearer required\n\n**Setup**\n1. Set `baseUrl` (e.g. `http://localhost:5001`)\n2. Run **States** → **Cities** → **Areas** → **Pincodes** in order (test scripts save `stateId`, `cityId`, `areaId`, `pincode`)\n3. Set **`categoryId`**, **`serviceId`** to real Mongo ObjectIds for update.\n4. Run **Register** or **Login** — saves `{{token}}` and `{{email}}`\n5. **Update partner** — form-data; select **`image`** and **`aadhar_card`** files (profile max 512 KB)\n\n**Update — required:** `image`, `aadhar_card`, `gender`, `experience`, `state_id`, `city_id`, `area_id`, `pincode` (postal code **string** from pincodes API), `address`, `partner_services`, `bank_account`.\n\n**Location response:** `{ success, status, message, records }` — **Update/other:** `{ success, status, message, data }`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Partner",
      "description": "Partner mobile app — `routes/mobile/partner/index.js`",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "try {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  const t = j?.data?.auth_token;",
                  "  if (t) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', t);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', t);",
                  "  }",
                  "  if (j?.data?._id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('partnerId', String(j.data._id));",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', String(j.data._id));",
                  "  }",
                  "  if (j?.data?.email) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('email', String(j.data.email));",
                  "  }",
                  "} catch (e) {}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Priya\",\n  \"date_of_birth\": \"2003-05-23\",\n  \"phone_number\": \"+916309654123\",\n  \"email\": \"partner.mobile+{{$timestamp}}@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Priya@123\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/partner/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "mobile", "partner", "register"]
            },
            "description": "**POST /api/mobile/partner/register**\n\n- No Authorization\n- **Required:** name, email, phone_number, password, date_of_birth (age 18+)\n- Creates partner (`verification_status` 1)\n- Auto-assigns **basic** subscription on register (`expires_at` null)\n- Response: `data` with `auth_token`"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "try {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
