                "description": "**GET /api/mobile/partner/states**\n\n- No Authorization\n- Returns active, non-deleted states\n- Response: `{ success, status, message, records }` — each record is a state document (`_id`, `name`, …)\n- Test script sets `{{stateId}}` from first record"
