            "description": "**PUT /api/mobile/partner/update**\n\n**Transport:** `multipart/form-data` only (Postman Body → form-data; do not set Content-Type header manually).\n\n**Auth:** Bearer `{{token}}` — updates logged-in partner only.\n\n### Required on every request\n| Field | Notes |\n|-------|--------|\n| `image` | Profile photo file, max **512 KB** |\n| `aadhar_card` | Aadhar file (JPEG/PNG/PDF, max 10 MB) |\n| `gender` | `male`, `female`, or `other` |\n| `experience` | Non-empty text |\n| `state_id` | Valid Mongo ObjectId |\n| `city_id` | Valid Mongo ObjectId |\n| `area_id` | Valid Mongo ObjectId |\n| `pincode` | Postal code **string** from `GET /api/mobile/partner/pincodes?area_id=` |\n| `address` | Non-empty text |\n| `partner_services` | JSON array — each service needs `category_id`, `service_id`, `description`, `price` |\n| `bank_account` | JSON with `bank_name`, `branch_name`, `account_holder_name`, `account_number`, `ifsc_code` |\n\n### Optional\n`name`, `date_of_birth`, `email`, `phone_number`, `device_token`, `password` + `confirm_password`, `partner_documents`, other document files (`pan_card`, `driving_license`, etc.)\n\n### Not accepted (ignored if sent)\n`partner_subscription`, `subscription_plan_id` — subscription is assigned on **register** only.\n\n**Variables:** Run **Location** folder first for `stateId`, `cityId`, `areaId`, `pincode`; set `categoryId`, `serviceId` manually."
